<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahrend details stock 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Ahrend details stock 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch office equipment group Koninklijke Ahrend NV said on Tuesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 65 held.</p>
<p>In March, Ahrend announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.90 guilders, up from 1.55 in 1995, or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Ahrend shares were trading at 123.00 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Tuesday, up 1.50 guilders from Monday's close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
